*> PERFORM FOREVER is an inline loop that only EXIT PERFORM, GO TO,
*> or STOP RUN leaves.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. F.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N PIC 9 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    PERFORM FOREVER
        ADD 1 TO N
        IF N > 3
            EXIT PERFORM
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    DISPLAY N
    STOP RUN.
